Yeah, since the first time "icebox ascension" was mentioned here, I have
made a point of bringing an icebox with me to the Demigod bar on the first
ascension of every Nethack version released after that.

And for each version I have always done it by wishing the icebox when
already standing on the high altar ready to #offer the amulet. I have
never carried one across dungeon levels.

Once I burnt two wands of wishing to do that, with each wish getting an
ice box with heavy corpses inside so that I couldn't hold it in my hands.
Then I tried a stupid thing: I stripped naked and dropped everything to
try if I could THEN take the heavy corpse out of one of the iceboxes on
the altar. I couldn't. 
But guess who came in just when I had found it out, before I picked up my
stuff? 

Yeah, Pestilence.

I knew I COULD have just picked up the Amulet and #offered it to ascend
with an empty inventory (which would also have been a nice stupid trick),
but instead I hit Pestilence barehanded (or did something equal to that, I
don't remember for sure) and didn't survive many rounds..

It was YASD that didn't feel bad at all. It made me laugh. I had been
standing there, ready to ascend within one move, for a long time, just
trying to get an ice box I could carry.
The next time I reached Astral, I managed to ascend with an ice box as I
intended. 

